`usePermissions()` falls back to an allow-all implementation when the provider is missing. That makes permission checks silently fail open (e.g., forgetting to wrap the app in `PermissionProvider` would grant access). Consider failing closed (deny by default) and/or throwing in development to avoid accidental privilege escalation.
```suggestion
    // In development, surface misconfiguration loudly
    if (process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production') {
      throw new Error('usePermissions must be used within a PermissionProvider');
    }

    // In production, fail closed: deny all permissions by default
    return {
      check: (): PermissionCheckResult => ({ allowed: false }),
      checkField: () => false,
      getFieldPermissions: () => [],
      getRowFilter: () => undefined,
      roles: [],
      isLoaded: false,
      can: () => false,
      cannot: () => true,
```

This component relies on inline `style` for layout sizing/background rendering. Inline styles are discouraged in this codebase (Tailwind-first) and make theming harder. Consider expressing these via Tailwind classes/CSS variables (e.g., set CSS vars for width/height/grid size) and use classes instead of `style={{...}}`.
```suggestion
          <style>{`
            .page-designer-canvas {
              width: ${canvas.width * zoom}px;
              height: ${canvas.height * zoom}px;
              ${canvas.showGrid
                ? `background-image: radial-gradient(circle, hsl(var(--border)) 1px, transparent 1px);`
                : ''}
              ${canvas.showGrid && canvas.gridSize
                ? `background-size: ${canvas.gridSize * zoom}px ${canvas.gridSize * zoom}px;`
                : ''}
            }
            ${components
              .map(
                (comp) => `
            .page-designer-component[data-comp-id="${comp.id}"] {
              left: ${comp.position.x * zoom}px;
              top: ${comp.position.y * zoom}px;
              width: ${
                typeof comp.position.width === 'number'
                  ? `${comp.position.width * zoom}px`
                  : comp.position.width
              };
              height: ${
                typeof comp.position.height === 'number'
                  ? `${comp.position.height * zoom}px`
                  : comp.position.height
              };
            }
            `,
              )
              .join('\n')}
          `}</style>
          <div
            className="relative bg-background border rounded shadow-sm mx-auto page-designer-canvas"
          >
            {components.map((comp) => (
              <div
                key={comp.id}
                data-comp-id={comp.id}
                className={cn(
                  'absolute border rounded cursor-move select-none transition-shadow page-designer-component',
                  selectedId === comp.id
                    ? 'border-primary ring-2 ring-primary/20 shadow-md'
                    : 'border-border hover:border-primary/50',
                )}
```

